a\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0642\u0650\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"Dan apabila perkataan (ketentuan masa kehancuran alam) telah berlaku atas mereka, Kami keluarkan makhluk bergerak yang bernyawa dari bumi yang akan mengatakan kepada mereka bahwa manusia dahulu tidak yakin kepada ayat-ayat Kami.","enText":"And when the word befalls them, We will bring forth for them a creature from the earth speaking to them, [saying] that the people were, of Our verses, not certain [in faith].","readText":"wa i\u017c\u0101 waqa'al-qaulu 'alaihim akhrajn\u0101 lahum d\u0101bbatam minal-ar\u1e0di tukallimuhum annan-n\u0101sa k\u0101n\u1ee5 bi`\u0101y\u0101tin\u0101 l\u0101 y\u1ee5qin\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/027082.mp3","juz":20,"manzil":5,"page":384,"ruku":332,"hizbQuarter":154,"sajda":false},{"verseId":83,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u064a\u064e\u0648\u0652\u0645\u064e \u0646\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0634\u064f\u0631\u064f \u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0643\u064f\u0644\u0651\u0650 \u0627\u064f\u0645\u0651\u064e\u0629\u064d \u0641\u064e\u0648\u0652\u062c\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0645\u0651\u064e\u0646\u0652 \u064a\u0651\u064f\u0643\u064e\u0630\u0651\u0650\u0628\u064f \u0628\u0650\u0627\u0670\u064a\u0670\u062a\u0650\u0646\u064e\u0627 \u0641\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u064a\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0632\u064e\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"Dan (ingatlah) pada hari (ketika) Kami mengumpulkan dari setiap umat, segolongan orang yang mendustakan ayat-ayat Kami, lalu mereka dibagi-bagi (dalam kelompok-kelompok).","enText":"And [warn of] the Day when We will gather from every nation a company of those who deny Our signs, and they will be [driven] in rows","readText":"wa yauma na\u1e25syuru ming kulli ummatin faujam mim may yuka\u017c\u017cibu bi`\u0101y\u0101tin\u0101 fa hum y\u1ee5za'\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/027083.mp3","juz":20,"manzil":5,"page":384,"ruku":333,"hizbQuarter":154,"sajda":fa